   00584|     // they had not asked in.
   00585|     // The four after them are the primacy kinds issue #1073 added: `citation`,
   00586|     // `first_hand_record`, `self_published` and `editorial_synthesis` are the
   00587|     // vocabulary a source uses to say how close it stands to what it reports,
   00588|     // and every source in `data/seed/sources-registry.lino` now names one of
